
			Medusa Authorization Server
				Constable

RCS: $Id: README,v 1.3 2002/12/06 17:59:17 anonymous Exp $

What you need:

	1) Installed Medusa DS9 kernel patch.
	2) Installed libmcompiler-1.0 or later.
		http://terminus.sk/~marek/prog/libmcompiler.shtml (slovak language)
		http://terminus.sk/~marek/prog/libmcompiler-1.0.tgz (C language ;-)

Configuration:

	Edit Makefile

Compilation:

	make

The historical force-code loader has been retired. Its Linux-2.x
implementation depended on removed syscall wrappers and 32-bit interfaces and
was already excluded from the supported build. The retained mini-libc
formatter is bounded and independently tested, but is not a supported
force-code execution path. See `../docs/retired-components.md`.

Installation:

	make install

Help:

	constable -h

Documentation:

	Now only in Slovak language. File Dokumentacia.

 ;-) Sorry. Some usefull documentation come soon.
